+
+/**
+ * Approximates the "Tekstur" gallery filter on the description sheet's cards.
+ *
+ * Measured on four artwork pairs, the filter lowers brightness to about 50–75% and saturation to
+ * about 77–92%. The filter's own curves are proprietary (.videofx), so this is a fitted
+ * approximation: value x [VALUE_GAIN], saturation x [SATURATION_GAIN], hue unchanged.
+ *
+ * Only the card containers are changed. Text and link colours stay as they were, so the copy
+ * keeps its contrast.
